~ Importing a module: `use` loads the file once and returns a module value.
"./lib/geometry" -> use => geometry

2.0 -> geometry/circle-area -> io/print-line
geometry/square-area => square-area
3 -> square-area -> io/print-line
"circle" -> geometry/describe (1.0 -> geometry/circle-area) -> io/print-line
geometry -> module/names -> io/print-line
geometry/pi -> io/print-line

attempt | geometry/secret recover e | e -> io/print-line
